  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRIO Bundle Agreement 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal/ impact of the project is to enhance understanding of current conflicts and to strengthen the capacity of stakeholders and peacemakingactors to prevent, mitigate and resolve armed conflicts. The project supports research on Conflict Trends, Gender Peace and Security, and peace processes in different geographic and thematic areas.</narrative>
  </description>
